Z||000000||Boomtastic||08-31-2001||06:35 PM||||We all have some rare Fiero items. You know - items that people can't believe even exist. What's yours? Below I've posted a few of mine to get people started.<P>1989 Fiero Emblems, still on paper backing from GM Design Studio in MI<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/89_Fiero_Emblem.jpg"> <P>1984 Indy Pit Badges, both brass and platinum colors<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DSC00002_2.jpg"> <P>1984 Indy Pace Car license plate, from one of the promotional cars driven before the Indy race<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DSC00003_1.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||5
