Z||000014||mrfiero||08-31-2001||09:09 PM||||Here are a few of my "rare" items.<P>First is a brand new set of real Mecham side scoops.....the urethane ones like Skitime mentioned.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mechamscoops.JPG">  <P><BR>Here is a brand new '88 tan 5-sp. shifter console.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/shifterplate.JPG">  <P><BR>To compliment the new shifter console, here's a brand new '88 tan leather manual shift knob.  I think this is "super rare"...I have not seen another one (that wasn't already on a car).<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/shiftknob.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 08-31-2001).]||||reg||6
