Z||000016||RossT||08-31-2001||09:17 PM||||When I bought my first fiero from a former Pontiac executive, as I was about to drive away, he said "wait".  Came back a few minutes later with a trunk full of misc. stuff that he collected while at Pontiac. One of the items was a limited edition print called: Fiero at Watkins Glen.  Ray Paulk is the only other person I know that has one!!  He got his used to hang in John Deloreans office (or something like that).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image001_3.jpg"> <P>one on the left is watkins glenn||||reg||1
