Z||000026||CoolBlue87GT||08-31-2001||11:39 PM||||I have three things that I am told are rare.<P>One is instructions on installing the sunroof "pad" and the velco to the glass.<BR>It came inside the black bag that holds the pad or the sunroof.<P>Another is the parking brake instructions that were printed and wrapped around the sunvisor.<P>The other is the Parts and Illustration Catalog that was given to each dealer. It is 84 - 88, and <BR>was puplished January 1988.<P>It contains part numbers for every last part in the Fiero.<P>A friend that works in the parts dept gave it to me when GM told the dealers to throw them out.<p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 08-31-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000027||Boomtastic||09-01-2001||12:02 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Black88GT:<BR><B>Hey Eric, I remember those emblems.  I hate to break it to you but I am pretty sure they are phony.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>[snip]<P>Doesn't sound like the same guy. We had a long talk about these emblems, and the guy used names that only people on the inside would know (I knew the names because I had dealt with them during my years working closely with Oldsmobile and their Rocket Parts division, as well as the lead publisher of the Performance Catalog). <P>Also, I use the term "emblems", not decals. These are a rubberized type of emblem (much like the front fascia emblem, but without the black plastic retainer) - very flexible, with adhesive on one side. The picture doesn't do it justice. The colors are absolutely stunning!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000028||mrfiero||09-01-2001||12:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by skitime:<BR><B>MrFiero Nice collection.  I think you should sell me all three.  hehe</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Make me an offer I can't refuse!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> ||||reg||1
